Fixed Ohm’s turret regression. Across ten seeds, the stationary turret fired **0/85 rounds off/on before the fix and 0/0 after it**. Median Rivet HP lost fell from 4 to 0 with the move enabled. The flanking turret also fired **0/0**. Flanking cut kill time from 7.83 s to 4.02 s in both arms because ordinary bolts already kept the turret stunned.

